  <div class="pl-risks">
    <aside class="callout callout-risk"><div class="callout-hd">R1 · Benchmark misses 2 seconds at 50 decisions per second</div><div class="callout-body">Decisions every tick are the dominant cost. Step 15 measures early; a miss reopens the decision rate and the tick rate with the product owner (NFR-1 yields to C2). Levers in order: decision interval, spatial grid, fewer pass candidates.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">R2 · Byte-identical output breaks</div><div class="callout-body">No HashMap on the simulation path; pairwise loops by index; the determinism test runs on every verify; the reproducibility boundary is same machine, same build, same C runtime.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">R3 · Steering oscillation around anchors</div><div class="callout-body">Arrive radius and damping live in tuning; the validator test tunes them before the visible milestone.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-info"><div class="callout-hd">R4 · crates.io unreachable at first build</div><div class="callout-body">Cargo uses its own fetch path. If it fails, implement records the wall and falls back to the cached rand 0.8.5 and clap 4.5.60 with the API differences noted.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-info"><div class="callout-hd">R5 · Partial tick file after an abort</div><div class="callout-body">The reader fails closed on a missing trailer or a count mismatch; the dark-path signal in the instrumentation plan covers it.</div></aside>
  </div>
